CORRECTED TEMPERATURE READ (quote-aware parse; supersedes limb3_temperature_aliasing.out)
================================================================================
DEFECT IN THE PRIOR PROBE: it split story_provenance args on ',' while sampling_params
values themselves contain ','. Arg 8 was truncated at the first comma, so compound values
read as their max_tokens prefix and their temperature term was DROPPED.

